    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d801">

                <pb facs="1403" n="1356" xml:id="pg1356"/>

                <head>801. Telegram 491 from Prague<anchor n="1" xml:id="d801-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Prague</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1957-04-08">April 8, 1957,
                        noon</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d801-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d801-1"/>
                <p>491. Mytel 487.</p>
                <p>Wang has replied not possible meet before
                    May 15. In view desirability my meeting with him after his return from Peiping
                    and before my consultation with Department have agreed to May 15 meeting. Usual
                    announcement postponement meeting will be made at Geneva but have authorized PAO
                    there inform any press inquirers on background basis postponement at Wang’s request.</p>
                <p>At May 15 meeting will propose July 11 for next following meeting.</p>
                <p>Plan depart Geneva evening May 15 arriving Washington afternoon May 16.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
